lineup Two scenes of a transfer queue [scenes: pick]

box wait as Waiting
box done as Done
box out as Sent back

item a, b, c

step Line up
  say Three transfers wait in line. Every scene shares the steps up to here.
  line wait: a, b, c

scene Transfer goes through
  step Send
    say The first one moves to done.
    line wait: b, c
    line done: a
end

scene Wrong payee
  step Send back
    say The first one moves to sent back. This scene stops here.
    line wait: b, c
    line out: a
    stop The payee is not registered
end
